;-------------------------------------------------
; "ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;  初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;  TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K88
SELECTCASE TIME:2
	CASE 1,2
		PRINTFORMW 「GOOD MORNING!」
	CASE 3,4
		PRINTFORMW 「GOOD DAY!」
	CASEELSE
		; 誤字じゃないよわざとだよウサだけど
		PRINTFORMW 「GOOD EVENING!!1!」
ENDSELECT
;The line that references Byakuren's name used the code %K88_KYOKO_CALLNAME(55)% to retrieve her name, but at the time of writing this comment (21/10/2022) that function appears to be handling honorifics wrong. 
PRINTFORML With a voice loud enough to make one want to plug one's ears, 
PRINTFORMW a girl with a bamboo broom and floppy ears comes running at you, a cloud of dust behind her.
PRINTFORMW 「So you're the newcomer Byakuren-sama mentioned. Could you let me know your name?」
SIF FIRSTTIME("U88-1")
	PRINTL  
CALL K88_KYOKO_INPUT_CALLNAME
PRINTFORMW 「%MASTERNAME:88%, is it? Got it!」
PRINTFORMW After exchanging pleasantries, you proceed asking each other questions.
PRINTFORMW Considering the intense barrage of questions thrown at you, she really seems like a very energetic and excitable girl.
SETBIT TCVAR:350, (TIME:2 - 1)
CFLAG:1100 = K88_KYOKO_GET_VARSION()
RETURN 1

