@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K88_1(ARG, ARG:1)
;地の文表示
LOCAL = 1
IF LOCAL
	PRINTFORMW Kyouko suddenly stops ahead of you just as you were about to reach the entrance to %GET_MAPNAME(MAIN_MAP)%.
	PRINTFORMW You wonder what's wrong, but she remains silent. Instead, you decide to approach her.
	PRINTFORMW Without much time for surprise, Kyouko quickly \@ K88_KYOKO_DIFF_BODYSIZE(TARGET, MASTER) >= 0 ? stretches out # leans over \@ and steals a kiss from you.
	PRINTFORMW It came completely out of left field, leaving you no time to react that you even lost the sense of time.
	PRINTFORMW Leaving you dumbfounded, Kyouko parrots the words you just said to her.
	PRINTFORMW And as her face was turning red, she darts deeper into the area with a squeal.
	PRINTL 
	PRINTFORMW When you regain your composure, you promptly chase after her as she keeps running away blushing.
	PRINTFORMW All you could do is to wish that this moment would have been a bit more special...
ENDIF
RETURN 1

